 {"en": "The Recalls and Safety alerts website is the official Government of Canada centralized website providing information on recalls and safety alerts related to food, consumer products, health products, medical devices, cannabis and vehicles sold in Canada. \r\n\r\nVisitors to the website can view the latest recalls and safety alerts, search new and archived information as well as subscribe to receive immediate or daily notifications via email.\r\n\r\nUpdated daily, the Recalls and Safety Alerts open dataset provides content for use on third party platforms or applications.", "fr": "Le site web Rappels et avis de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 est un site officiel centralis\u00e9 du gouvernement du Canada qui fournit des informations sur les rappels et les avis de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 li\u00e9s aux aliments, aux produits de consommation, aux produits de sant\u00e9, aux instruments m\u00e9dicaux, au cannabis et aux v\u00e9hicules vendus au Canada.\r\n\r\nLes visiteurs du site web peuvent consulter les derniers rappels et avis de s\u00e9curit\u00e9, rechercher des informations r\u00e9centes et archiv\u00e9es, ainsi que s\u2019abonner pour recevoir des notifications imm\u00e9diates ou quotidiennes par courrier \u00e9lectronique.\r\n\r\n\r\n"}, "num_resources": 4, "num_tags": 0, "org_section": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "org_title_at_publication": {"en": "Health Canada", "fr": "Sant\u00e9 Canada"}, "organization": {"id": "BD26DB5E-82D2-42C1-99BB-08FCF6068FEE", "name": "hc-sc", "title": "Health Canada | Sant\u00e9 Canada", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-09-23T17:25:33.001625", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "BD26DB5E-82D2-42C1-99BB-08FCF6068FEE", "place_of_publication": [], "portal_release_date": "2019-12-10", "position_name": {}, "private": false, "program_page_url": {"en": "https://recalls-rappels.canada.ca/en", "fr": "https://recalls-rappels.canada.ca/fr"}, "ready_to_publish": "t